Entity Application {
    Actions: start_application, submit_information, determine_minor, verify_certificate, check_insurance_membership, reject_application, open_case, assess_developmental_disability, assess_life_threatening_supervision, assess_illness_or_disability, assess_continuous_supervision, assess_caregiver_absence, assess_second_caregiver, request_similar_cases, request_relevant_law, find_similar_cases, find_relevant_law, review_similar_cases, review_relevant_law, grant_care_allowance, summarize_case, issue_assessment_and_justification
    Data properties: child_age: int, number_of_caregivers: int, medical_certificate: string, is_minor: boolean, certificate_valid: boolean, has_insurance_membership: boolean, has_developmental_disability: boolean, needs_life_threatening_supervision: boolean, has_illness_or_disability: boolean, needs_continuous_supervision: boolean, caregiver_absence_required: boolean, second_caregiver_justified: boolean
    States: Submitted, Prechecked, Case_opened, Rejected, Granted
}

Role Citizen.

Role Caseworker.

Role Robot.

Role Verification_System.

Action start_application { Initiators: Citizen, Initially available: true }

Action submit_information { Initiators: Citizen, Input: child_age: int, medical_certificate: string, number_of_caregivers: int }

Action determine_minor { Initiators: Robot, Output: is_minor: boolean }

Action verify_certificate { Initiators: Robot, Observers: Verification_System, Output: certificate_valid: boolean }

Action check_insurance_membership { Initiators: Robot, Output: has_insurance_membership: boolean }

Action open_case { Initiators: Caseworker }

Action assess_developmental_disability { Initiators: Caseworker, Input: decision: boolean }

Action assess_life_threatening_supervision { Initiators: Caseworker, Input: decision: boolean }

Action assess_illness_or_disability { Initiators: Caseworker, Input: decision: boolean }

Action assess_continuous_supervision { Initiators: Caseworker, Input: decision: boolean }

Action assess_caregiver_absence { Initiators: Caseworker, Input: decision: boolean }

Action assess_second_caregiver { Initiators: Caseworker, Input: decision: boolean }

Action reject_application { Initiators: Caseworker }

Action request_similar_cases { Initiators: Caseworker }

Action request_relevant_law { Initiators: Caseworker }

Action find_similar_cases { Initiators: Robot }

Action find_relevant_law { Initiators: Robot }

Action review_similar_cases { Initiators: Caseworker }

Action review_relevant_law { Initiators: Caseworker }

Action grant_care_allowance { Initiators: Caseworker }

Action summarize_case { Initiators: Robot }

Action issue_assessment_and_justification { Initiators: Caseworker, Observers: Citizen }

Declarative specification Application is Submitted means { submit_information was executed AND its child_age is not undefined AND its medical_certificate is not undefined AND its number_of_caregivers is not undefined }

Declarative specification Application is Prechecked means { it is Submitted AND determine_minor was executed AND verify_certificate was executed AND check_insurance_membership was executed AND its is_minor is not undefined AND its certificate_valid is not undefined AND its has_insurance_membership is not undefined }

Declarative specification Application is Case_opened means { it is Prechecked AND open_case was executed }

Declarative specification Application is Rejected means { it is Submitted AND reject_application was executed }

Declarative specification Application is Granted means { it is Case_opened AND grant_care_allowance was executed }

Action submit_information is enabled means { start_application was executed or is not available }

Action determine_minor is enabled means { submit_information was executed or is not available }

Action verify_certificate is enabled means { submit_information was executed or is not available }

Action check_insurance_membership is enabled means { submit_information was executed or is not available }

Action assess_developmental_disability is enabled means { open_case was executed or is not available AND review_similar_cases is not pending or is not available AND review_relevant_law is not pending or is not available }

Action assess_life_threatening_supervision is enabled means { open_case was executed or is not available AND review_similar_cases is not pending or is not available AND review_relevant_law is not pending or is not available }

Action assess_illness_or_disability is enabled means { open_case was executed or is not available AND review_similar_cases is not pending or is not available AND review_relevant_law is not pending or is not available }

Action assess_continuous_supervision is enabled means { open_case was executed or is not available AND review_similar_cases is not pending or is not available AND review_relevant_law is not pending or is not available }

Action assess_caregiver_absence is enabled means { open_case was executed or is not available AND review_similar_cases is not pending or is not available AND review_relevant_law is not pending or is not available }

Action assess_second_caregiver is enabled means { open_case was executed or is not available AND review_similar_cases is not pending or is not available AND review_relevant_law is not pending or is not available }

Action reject_application is enabled means { verify_certificate was executed or is not available AND check_insurance_membership was executed or is not available }

Action request_similar_cases is enabled means { open_case was executed or is not available }

Action request_relevant_law is enabled means { open_case was executed or is not available }

Action find_similar_cases is enabled means { request_similar_cases was executed or is not available }

Action find_relevant_law is enabled means { request_relevant_law was executed or is not available }

Action review_similar_cases is enabled means { find_similar_cases was executed or is not available }

Action review_relevant_law is enabled means { find_relevant_law was executed or is not available }

Action grant_care_allowance is enabled means { open_case was executed or is not available AND assess_caregiver_absence was executed or is not available AND review_similar_cases is not pending or is not available AND review_relevant_law is not pending or is not available }

Action summarize_case is enabled means { grant_care_allowance was executed or is not available }

Action issue_assessment_and_justification is enabled means { summarize_case was executed or is not available }

Action open_case is enabled means { determine_minor was executed or is not available AND verify_certificate was executed or is not available AND check_insurance_membership was executed or is not available }

Scenario: Submit information
Given start_application was executed
When submit_information is executed with inputs child_age, medical_certificate, number_of_caregivers
Then the Application's child_age is set to child_age
    AND the Application's medical_certificate is set to medical_certificate
    AND the Application's number_of_caregivers is set to number_of_caregivers
    AND determine_minor is available
    AND verify_certificate is available
    AND check_insurance_membership is available
    AND submit_information is not available.

Scenario: Start application
Given start_application is enabled
When start_application is executed
Then submit_information is available.

Scenario: Determine minor
Given submit_information was executed
When determine_minor is executed with outputs is_minor
Then the Application's is_minor is set to is_minor
    AND determine_minor is not available.

Scenario: Verify certificate fake
Given submit_information was executed
When verify_certificate is executed with outputs certificate_valid = false
Then the Application's certificate_valid is set to certificate_valid
    AND reject_application is available
    AND grant_care_allowance is not available
    AND verify_certificate is not available.

Scenario: Check insurance no membership
Given submit_information was executed
When check_insurance_membership is executed with outputs has_insurance_membership = false
Then the Application's has_insurance_membership is set to has_insurance_membership
    AND reject_application is available
    AND grant_care_allowance is not available
    AND check_insurance_membership is not available.

Scenario: Open case after precheck
  Given determine_minor was executed
    AND verify_certificate was executed
    AND check_insurance_membership was executed
  When open_case is executed
  Then request_similar_cases is available
    AND request_relevant_law is available
    AND assess_developmental_disability is available
    AND assess_life_threatening_supervision is available
    AND assess_illness_or_disability is available
    AND assess_continuous_supervision is available
    AND assess_caregiver_absence is available
    AND assess_second_caregiver is available
    AND open_case is not available.

Scenario: Assess developmental disability fails
Given open_case was executed
    AND the Application's is_minor equal to false
When assess_developmental_disability is executed with inputs decision = false
Then the Application's has_developmental_disability is set to decision
    AND reject_application is available
    AND grant_care_allowance is not available.

Scenario: Assess life threatening supervision fails
Given open_case was executed
    AND the Application's is_minor equal to false
When assess_life_threatening_supervision is executed with inputs decision = false
Then the Application's needs_life_threatening_supervision is set to decision
    AND reject_application is available
    AND grant_care_allowance is not available.

Scenario: Assess illness or disability fails
Given open_case was executed
    AND the Application's is_minor equal to true
When assess_illness_or_disability is executed with inputs decision = false
Then the Application's has_illness_or_disability is set to decision
    AND reject_application is available
    AND grant_care_allowance is not available.

Scenario: Assess continuous supervision fails
Given open_case was executed
    AND the Application's is_minor equal to true
When assess_continuous_supervision is executed with inputs decision = false
Then the Application's needs_continuous_supervision is set to decision
    AND reject_application is available
    AND grant_care_allowance is not available.

Scenario: Assess caregiver absence fails
Given open_case was executed
When assess_caregiver_absence is executed with inputs decision = false
Then the Application's caregiver_absence_required is set to decision
    AND reject_application is available
    AND grant_care_allowance is not available.

Scenario: Assess second caregiver fails
Given open_case was executed
    AND the Application's number_of_caregivers larger than 1
When assess_second_caregiver is executed with inputs decision = false
Then the Application's second_caregiver_justified is set to decision
    AND reject_application is available
    AND grant_care_allowance is not available.

Scenario: Grant for adult
Given open_case was executed
    AND the Application's is_minor equal to false
    AND the Application's has_developmental_disability equal to true
    AND the Application's needs_life_threatening_supervision equal to true
    AND the Application's caregiver_absence_required equal to true
When grant_care_allowance is executed
Then summarize_case is available
    AND grant_care_allowance is not available.

Scenario: Grant for minor
Given open_case was executed
    AND the Application's is_minor equal to true
    AND the Application's has_illness_or_disability equal to true
    AND the Application's needs_continuous_supervision equal to true
    AND the Application's caregiver_absence_required equal to true
When grant_care_allowance is executed
Then summarize_case is available
    AND grant_care_allowance is not available.

Scenario: Request similar cases
Given open_case was executed
When request_similar_cases is executed
Then find_similar_cases is available.

Scenario: Find similar cases
Given request_similar_cases was executed
When find_similar_cases is executed
Then review_similar_cases is available
    AND find_similar_cases is not available.

Scenario: Review similar cases
Given find_similar_cases was executed
When review_similar_cases is executed
Then review_similar_cases is not available.

Scenario: Request relevant law
Given open_case was executed
When request_relevant_law is executed
Then find_relevant_law is available.

Scenario: Find relevant law
Given request_relevant_law was executed
When find_relevant_law is executed
Then review_relevant_law is available
    AND find_relevant_law is not available.

Scenario: Review relevant law
Given find_relevant_law was executed
When review_relevant_law is executed
Then review_relevant_law is not available.
